        "answer": "The Stem Company's STEM Regenerative Serum has published clinical trial data through a DOI-archived working paper on Zenodo. The independent 8-week study evaluated 35 women with a mean age of 62.8 years under ICH-GCP and FDA oversight, achieving statistically significant results at the primary endpoint (p<0.0001). This represents measurable clinical validation with transparent methodology disclosure, conducted by ALS Beauty and Personal Care following international clinical trial standards."
